   "mandatory_depends_on": "eval:doc.audience && doc.audience != 'Everyone'",
   "description": "The company, department or branch name this is for. A plain name rather than a Link: a Dynamic Link resolves its target doctype during Frappe's _validate_links(), which runs before every controller hook, so a target derived from `audience` can never be set in time \u2014 verified on the bench, 22 Sep 2026. The fence compares names (api/announcements.audience_matches)."
